WEBVTT

01:29.410 --> 01:34.390
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.870 --> 01:37.820
[Episode 4]

02:11.650 --> 02:12.980
Can't you recognize me,

02:13.400 --> 02:13.840
Mom?

02:16.970 --> 02:17.850
How could I not?

02:20.430 --> 02:21.300
I didn't expect

02:21.460 --> 02:22.710
you'd be so grown up.

02:24.740 --> 02:25.930
You're a bit taller

02:26.350 --> 02:27.490
than I imagined.

02:28.860 --> 02:29.720
Over the years,

02:30.360 --> 02:31.690
I've always missed you.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.800
You haven't changed a bit,

02:37.850 --> 02:39.630
just the same as before.

02:44.090 --> 02:44.850
I'm old now.

02:46.960 --> 02:48.740
But seeing you grow up healthy

02:48.760 --> 02:49.890
puts my mind at ease.

02:51.490 --> 02:52.140
Really?

02:53.000 --> 02:53.550
Really.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.910
I'm truly relieved.

02:57.810 --> 02:59.329
Meeting me on an occasion

02:59.360 --> 03:00.290
like this today,

03:01.210 --> 03:02.870
are you really at ease?

03:06.560 --> 03:08.030
Are you and Lu Xixiao

03:08.060 --> 03:09.120
in the same class?

03:10.090 --> 03:11.350
What does he know?

03:14.000 --> 03:15.000
What could

03:15.320 --> 03:16.070
he know?

03:18.140 --> 03:19.700
He can't know anything.

03:21.680 --> 03:22.230
He doesn't know

03:22.230 --> 03:24.160
that you actually have a daughter.

03:27.730 --> 03:28.480
Zhou Wan,

03:28.560 --> 03:30.970
we haven't seen each other
for over ten years.

03:30.970 --> 03:31.960
Do you think

03:32.740 --> 03:33.930
the Lu family cares

03:33.960 --> 03:35.760
whether I have a daughter or not?

03:39.250 --> 03:40.670
How far

03:41.910 --> 03:43.440
have you and Lu Xixiao gone?

03:48.550 --> 03:49.410
We're friends.

03:51.040 --> 03:51.950
Just friends?

04:01.450 --> 04:03.810
You got me to come here with a phone call

04:05.230 --> 04:07.090
and threatened me with Lu Xixiao.

04:08.610 --> 04:10.140
You just want money, right?

04:12.380 --> 04:13.460
If you want money,

04:14.020 --> 04:15.080
I can give it to you.

04:15.720 --> 04:16.630
But

04:17.930 --> 04:18.990
you must leave him.

04:20.410 --> 04:22.810
The further from the Lu family,
the better.

04:27.260 --> 04:27.850
Okay?

04:32.050 --> 04:32.780
Don't worry.

04:34.680 --> 04:35.300
Here.

04:36.650 --> 04:37.270
Take it.

04:46.159 --> 04:47.370
From now on,

04:48.570 --> 04:50.790
you've never come to me,

04:51.210 --> 04:52.870
and I don't know you.

04:54.260 --> 04:56.500
Zhou Wan, you're an adult now.

04:57.100 --> 04:59.070
Adults must keep their word.

04:59.960 --> 05:01.600
Otherwise, deal with
your grandma's matters

05:01.600 --> 05:02.800
by yourself.

05:13.670 --> 05:14.920
Lu Xixiao is such

05:14.950 --> 05:16.430
an arrogant person.

05:16.890 --> 05:18.070
If he knew

05:18.360 --> 05:20.490
he was only worth the cost of medicine,

05:22.160 --> 05:23.890
wouldn't that be interesting?

06:17.260 --> 06:19.940
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

06:21.120 --> 06:22.970
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

06:23.360 --> 06:26.270
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

06:27.780 --> 06:29.460
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

06:30.730 --> 06:35.180
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

06:35.330 --> 06:38.550
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

06:40.550 --> 06:41.950
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

06:41.970 --> 06:43.340
♪ That I can fly ♪

06:45.880 --> 06:46.720
♪ Long time no see ♪

06:46.790 --> 06:48.080
♪ You haven't been here ♪

06:49.240 --> 06:51.740
♪ Stop watch has seen the changes ♪

06:50.310 --> 06:51.040
What?

06:52.420 --> 06:54.360
♪ I'm sure you won't forget ♪

06:52.620 --> 06:53.680
What are you doing?

06:54.390 --> 06:56.170
♪ The door you ever knocked ♪

06:54.950 --> 06:55.850
What?

06:55.870 --> 06:57.350
I asked what you are doing.

06:57.909 --> 07:00.030
♪ So I sent you a clock ♪

06:58.270 --> 07:00.000
I can't hear you.

07:00.050 --> 07:01.640
♪ To recover the deadlock ♪

07:03.080 --> 07:05.060
♪ It's like I'm losing my sword ♪

07:04.230 --> 07:06.060
I'm asking you

07:06.350 --> 07:09.190
♪ Chop off the line
between the loving core ♪

07:06.920 --> 07:08.000
what you are doing.

07:11.870 --> 07:14.320
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

07:15.950 --> 07:17.500
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

07:18.700 --> 07:21.080
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

07:22.840 --> 07:24.470
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

07:23.480 --> 07:25.060
The last customer has left,

07:25.090 --> 07:25.830
and you're still here

07:25.590 --> 07:28.840
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

07:25.830 --> 07:27.160
acting like an artisan.

07:27.240 --> 07:28.070
What's the rush?

07:28.070 --> 07:29.930
I'll just help you close the shop.

07:30.130 --> 07:33.220
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

07:30.470 --> 07:31.200
What's this?

07:31.600 --> 07:32.530
What is this for?

07:33.640 --> 07:35.240
What does it look like to you?

07:35.470 --> 07:37.560
♪ Nescience doesn't mean that I can fly ♪

07:36.980 --> 07:38.110
Like...

07:38.520 --> 07:39.720
Like a modified part.

07:41.170 --> 07:43.050
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

07:41.710 --> 07:43.320
You really have no imagination.

07:43.120 --> 07:45.080
♪ The dormer lock ♪

07:43.870 --> 07:44.960
This is...

07:45.530 --> 07:46.060
An arrow.

07:47.670 --> 07:49.150
Are you missing a bow?

07:47.980 --> 07:50.300
♪ Tell you starts were above the floor ♪

07:50.220 --> 07:51.080
Who gives a girl

07:51.120 --> 07:52.020
something like this?

07:52.020 --> 07:53.590
Because I'm an idiot, okay?

07:55.470 --> 07:56.290
I'll get going now.

07:56.290 --> 07:57.920
Remember to lock the door for me.

07:57.920 --> 07:58.480
Bye.

07:58.700 --> 07:59.180
Bye.

08:14.210 --> 08:15.270
Didn't sleep well?

08:18.270 --> 08:20.070
I reviewed a bit late last night.

08:21.280 --> 08:21.950
Since when do you

08:21.950 --> 08:23.160
stay up late to study?

08:26.830 --> 08:27.860
But I stayed up late last night

08:27.860 --> 08:29.720
putting together a collection
of new question types.

08:29.720 --> 08:31.650
I'll bring it to you when I get back.

08:31.790 --> 08:33.340
You've already got guaranteed admission.

08:33.340 --> 08:34.610
You don't have to do
practice questions with me.

08:34.610 --> 08:35.740
What's wrong with keeping you company?

08:35.740 --> 08:36.669
Do we need to draw

08:36.669 --> 08:38.270
such a clear line between us?

08:38.429 --> 08:39.530
I have nothing to do.

08:39.530 --> 08:40.240
If you have any trouble,

08:40.240 --> 08:41.640
you can always come to me.

08:42.480 --> 08:43.130
Thank you.

08:43.710 --> 08:44.640
You're welcome.

08:48.280 --> 08:48.960
Zhou Wan.

08:54.040 --> 08:54.840
I...

08:56.290 --> 08:57.550
I've thought about it.

08:58.630 --> 08:59.600
It's not that you can't

08:59.600 --> 09:00.790
be friends with Lu Xixiao.

09:00.790 --> 09:04.180
[Please close the door. Thank you.]

09:01.500 --> 09:02.150
It's just that...

09:02.150 --> 09:03.880
Lu Xixiao and I are not friends.

09:06.030 --> 09:07.000
We weren't before,

09:06.670 --> 09:08.750
[Please close the door. Thank you.]

09:07.020 --> 09:08.620
and we won't be in the future.

10:05.440 --> 10:08.870
Wan, there are only 9 days left
until the college entrance exam.

10:05.670 --> 10:09.400
[College Entrance Exam Countdown: 9 days]

10:08.900 --> 10:10.030
According to my statistics,

10:10.030 --> 10:11.210
math classes

10:11.230 --> 10:12.750
run over time by an average

10:12.790 --> 10:14.010
of 3 minutes and 27 seconds.

10:14.010 --> 10:15.850
But the break is only 10 minutes.

10:16.020 --> 10:16.690
If I take a nap...

10:16.690 --> 10:18.570
-I watched a video last weekend...
-drink some water...

10:18.570 --> 10:20.240
-and got to see Marquez’s cornering lean.
-and also need to go to the bathroom...

10:20.240 --> 10:22.140
how could there possibly be enough time?

10:22.140 --> 10:23.590
-His knee pads...
-Let's take the stairs over there.

10:23.590 --> 10:24.510
were grinding out sparks on the ground.

10:24.510 --> 10:25.600
Aren't the stairs over there farther?

10:25.600 --> 10:26.170
The college entrance exam is coming,

10:26.170 --> 10:27.230
I need to exercise.

10:27.400 --> 10:28.550
Zhou Wan!

10:29.880 --> 10:32.280
Why is she running
so fast during the break?

10:34.080 --> 10:36.040
I'm not finished yet. Let's go.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.240
I even dreamed at night

10:39.240 --> 10:40.160
that my cornering angle

10:40.160 --> 10:41.310
was exactly the same

10:41.340 --> 10:42.270
as Marquez's

10:42.320 --> 10:43.120
in that video.

10:43.130 --> 10:43.890
My knee pads were on the ground

10:43.490 --> 10:45.180
♪ People ask me how to heal ♪

10:43.920 --> 10:44.730
grinding out sparks,

10:44.730 --> 10:45.570
you know?

10:48.220 --> 10:51.240
♪ But what's the point
of questioning and leaving? ♪

10:55.110 --> 10:57.450
♪ Naiveness is always used
in the wrong place ♪

11:00.790 --> 11:03.390
♪ Sadly, I didn't notice anything ♪

11:10.820 --> 11:11.710
You have it.

11:11.260 --> 11:12.900
♪ The panic in your steps ♪

11:14.200 --> 11:15.840
♪ Is the symphony named betrayal ♪

11:23.650 --> 11:25.340
♪ Your silent answer ♪

11:26.650 --> 11:30.990
♪ Is the confusion
that pushed me to the valley bottom ♪

11:30.530 --> 11:31.120
Well.

11:31.280 --> 11:33.200
You've stared a hole
through this necklace.

11:31.880 --> 11:34.100
♪ Me and myself ♪

11:33.470 --> 11:34.860
Isn't it about Zhou Wan?

11:35.710 --> 11:37.060
♪ The unsettled self ♪

11:35.750 --> 11:37.620
If you ask me,
you two are really star-crossed.

11:37.620 --> 11:38.940
You didn't meet earlier or later,

11:38.490 --> 11:40.170
♪ Dancing at night ♪

11:39.120 --> 11:40.460
but exactly when you passed
your language test

11:40.320 --> 11:42.880
♪ I want to calm my broken heart ♪

11:40.600 --> 11:41.710
and are about to go abroad,

11:41.710 --> 11:42.690
you two fell for each other.

11:42.690 --> 11:44.580
If I were you, I'd be conflicted too.

11:44.580 --> 11:46.310
♪ Looking at myself ♪

11:44.790 --> 11:45.240
Fell for what?

11:45.240 --> 11:46.360
Who said I like her?

11:46.390 --> 11:47.480
Who said I'm conflicted?

11:47.480 --> 11:48.290
You don't like her?

11:47.760 --> 11:49.610
♪ With those traces of being teased ♪

11:48.320 --> 11:49.260
Then why did you give her

11:49.260 --> 11:51.180
that huge bunch of balloons
on mobilization day?

11:50.590 --> 11:55.580
♪ I want to show my love
but I always step on the glass ♪

11:52.750 --> 11:53.610
Don't I usually give you

11:53.610 --> 11:55.070
motorcycle accessories?

11:55.250 --> 11:56.580
What's the difference?

11:57.050 --> 11:59.080
♪ If promises can't be broken ♪

11:57.680 --> 11:58.740
So that's how it is.

11:59.650 --> 12:00.240
Looking at it this way,

12:00.240 --> 12:01.080
in this room today,

12:01.080 --> 12:02.030
only Ping is suffering

12:02.030 --> 12:03.030
for love.

12:03.130 --> 12:05.390
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

12:05.950 --> 12:08.940
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

12:06.370 --> 12:07.480
Come on, Ping!

12:08.290 --> 12:11.270
♪ I'm the only one left to heal myself ♪

12:11.640 --> 12:12.500
Let him suffer.

12:12.530 --> 12:13.660
I'll eat my hot food.

12:14.090 --> 12:15.350
What's wrong with him?

12:15.660 --> 12:16.860
His girlfriend is mad

12:16.890 --> 12:18.030
and impossible to coax.

12:18.030 --> 12:19.280
His girlfriend says that

12:19.280 --> 12:20.150
from the very beginning,

12:20.150 --> 12:21.390
the first day they met,

12:21.390 --> 12:22.550
everything has been a mistake.

12:22.550 --> 12:23.510
Loving is wrong,

12:23.510 --> 12:24.640
and hating is wrong.

12:25.570 --> 12:27.270
If they stay on the phone a bit longer,

12:27.270 --> 12:29.200
all of human history will be wrong.

12:32.810 --> 12:34.540
Why haven't they broken up yet?

12:35.320 --> 12:36.270
Can you really take

12:36.270 --> 12:38.150
what a girlfriend says seriously?

12:38.150 --> 12:39.000
If she still has time

12:39.000 --> 12:40.350
to deny this and that,

12:40.510 --> 12:41.890
she doesn't want to break up.

12:41.890 --> 12:43.220
What is said at this time

12:43.510 --> 12:45.350
must be carefully and rigorously

12:45.350 --> 12:46.710
analyzed word by word.

12:46.820 --> 12:48.610
Every conclusion drawn

12:48.910 --> 12:50.370
leads to a different fate.

12:57.430 --> 13:02.440
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

12:58.030 --> 13:00.090
So you're a relationship expert now.

13:00.160 --> 13:01.430
It's not me.

13:01.610 --> 13:03.340
That's what people say online.

13:04.760 --> 13:05.820
Then let me ask you.

13:06.800 --> 13:08.330
Hypothetically speaking,

13:11.600 --> 13:12.720
you have a friend.

13:16.100 --> 13:17.510
You did nothing wrong,

13:18.680 --> 13:19.940
and nothing happened.

13:21.090 --> 13:22.260
But she just...

13:23.700 --> 13:24.250
just

13:25.450 --> 13:26.840
suddenly denies you're friends

13:26.840 --> 13:28.310
and ignores you.

13:29.570 --> 13:30.830
Why? What does it mean?

13:33.240 --> 13:34.020
Come on.

13:36.030 --> 13:37.760
I can figure this out right now.

13:39.550 --> 13:41.280
This friend is Zhou Wan, right?

13:42.500 --> 13:44.420
Why don't you ask her yourself

13:44.510 --> 13:45.870
what the problem is

13:46.040 --> 13:47.240
and if it can be fixed?

13:47.330 --> 13:48.120
Right?

13:48.310 --> 13:49.420
Friends

13:49.440 --> 13:51.080
make solemn vows.

13:51.250 --> 13:53.450
They can't just unilaterally break up.

13:54.760 --> 13:57.360
I really shouldn't
have asked you, seriously.

14:34.080 --> 14:34.670
Hey.

14:35.940 --> 14:36.780
Are you crazy?

14:36.810 --> 14:38.060
Do you know how to ride a motorcycle?

14:38.060 --> 14:39.510
Do you know who I am?

14:43.790 --> 14:44.870
Without your dad,

14:45.470 --> 14:46.590
you are nobody.

14:46.800 --> 14:47.530
He Wenhui.

14:49.070 --> 14:49.740
What is it?

14:54.870 --> 14:55.550
Forget it.

14:55.580 --> 14:57.100
Wenhui, let's go.

14:57.130 --> 14:58.070
Mr. He said not to cause trouble.

14:58.070 --> 14:59.160
It's about to rain.

14:59.180 --> 14:59.820
Go away!

15:01.170 --> 15:01.770
Forget it.

15:01.800 --> 15:03.460
The road is a dangerous place.

15:07.780 --> 15:09.380
I don't want to see you again.

15:21.540 --> 15:22.180
Get on.

15:24.540 --> 15:25.710
I'm not getting on.

15:27.510 --> 15:28.240
It's raining so hard.

15:28.240 --> 15:29.440
Are you going to walk?

15:31.820 --> 15:34.440
It's fine, the rain isn't that heavy.

15:36.910 --> 15:37.750
I must be out of my mind

15:37.750 --> 15:38.720
meddling in

15:38.720 --> 15:39.740
your business all day.

15:39.740 --> 15:40.270
Here.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.530
♪ Fast footsteps ♪

16:15.030 --> 16:16.750
♪ When we just stepped out,
we didn't meet ♪

16:15.950 --> 16:20.100
[College Entrance Exam Countdown: 7 days]

16:16.780 --> 16:18.790
♪ Yet already in impatience ♪

16:20.130 --> 16:22.340
[College Entrance Exam Countdown]

16:20.280 --> 16:23.340
♪ In the air after the rain ♪

16:22.370 --> 16:23.300
Thank you, Meng.

16:23.370 --> 16:26.970
♪ Everything is filled with joy ♪

16:24.120 --> 16:25.160
You're welcome.

16:31.370 --> 16:32.630
You got this one right.

16:32.870 --> 16:33.610
Yes.

16:34.240 --> 16:35.220
And this one is B.

16:35.270 --> 16:40.320
♪ Let me sink into the time
when you are here ♪

16:35.550 --> 16:37.220
Wan,

16:38.060 --> 16:39.630
your hair is still wet.

16:39.630 --> 16:40.960
Remember to dry it later.

16:40.440 --> 16:43.590
♪ This world is always too cruel ♪

16:40.980 --> 16:42.130
The college entrance exam
is only 6 days away.

16:42.130 --> 16:43.710
You absolutely cannot catch a cold.

16:43.710 --> 16:48.890
♪ I'll accompany you
through all the adventures ♪

16:43.790 --> 16:45.670
What would I do if you catch a cold?

16:45.690 --> 16:46.870
Don't worry.

16:47.100 --> 16:48.760
Thanks to your spare uniform.

16:48.820 --> 16:50.000
I'll wash it when I get home

16:49.640 --> 16:51.940
♪ That's what makes it exciting ♪

16:50.000 --> 16:50.810
and return it to you immediately.

16:50.810 --> 16:51.390
Okay.

16:52.090 --> 16:57.070
♪ Let me sink into the time
when you are here ♪

16:54.250 --> 16:56.120
What's that novelty thing

16:56.180 --> 16:57.850
on your backpack?

16:57.230 --> 16:59.850
♪ This world is always too cruel ♪

17:01.040 --> 17:05.720
♪ With you here,
I can honestly admit my expectations ♪

17:01.280 --> 17:02.170
Can it be drawn?

17:04.160 --> 17:04.869
Yes.

17:05.310 --> 17:05.980
Like...

17:06.569 --> 17:07.579
♪ Beyond what I had imagined ♪

17:07.569 --> 17:08.220
this.

17:10.040 --> 17:11.800
I'm hit, Zhou Wan.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.440
You're like Cupid,

17:13.440 --> 17:15.230
striking my heart with an arrow.

17:15.230 --> 17:16.290
Alright. Alright.

17:17.119 --> 17:18.250
It's time for class.

17:18.460 --> 17:20.060
I haven't finished my notes.

17:29.900 --> 17:30.540
Zhou Wan.

17:34.300 --> 17:35.210
No, thanks.

17:41.150 --> 17:42.650
The college entrance exam is almost here,

17:41.210 --> 17:46.120
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

17:42.680 --> 17:44.480
and you're still late every day.

17:44.520 --> 17:45.700
I tell you what.

17:46.260 --> 17:47.990
You don't need to come anymore.

17:49.440 --> 17:50.740
Just go home and review.

17:50.740 --> 17:51.330
Really?

17:52.040 --> 17:53.190
Then thank you, sir.

17:53.350 --> 17:54.590
I'll pack my things and go home.

17:54.590 --> 17:55.190
Come back.

17:56.620 --> 17:57.810
Who told you to leave?

17:57.810 --> 17:58.980
You told me to leave.

17:59.000 --> 18:00.550
Can't you tell when I'm being sarcastic?

18:00.550 --> 18:01.350
Just now you told me to leave,

18:01.350 --> 18:01.880
now you tell me to come back.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.410
Should I stay or should I go?

18:03.920 --> 18:04.900
For someone like you,

18:04.900 --> 18:05.480
who doesn't even

18:05.480 --> 18:06.590
review properly at school,

18:06.590 --> 18:07.850
can you review at home?

18:08.290 --> 18:10.090
It's the same wherever I review.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.120
It's the same wherever you review,

18:11.120 --> 18:11.680
huh?

18:11.890 --> 18:15.360
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

18:12.120 --> 18:13.240
Disappear right now.

18:13.240 --> 18:14.370
Don't let me see you.

18:15.490 --> 18:17.230
No, please don't.

18:17.460 --> 18:18.680
Sir, I was wrong.

18:18.680 --> 18:19.640
I was wrong.

18:19.770 --> 18:22.170
There aren't many days
left of senior year.

18:22.510 --> 18:23.310
Look,

18:23.310 --> 18:23.830
you told me to leave,

18:23.830 --> 18:24.310
and now you want me back.

18:24.310 --> 18:25.740
-You must be reluctant to let me go.
-Excuse me.

18:25.740 --> 18:26.860
For the next few days,

18:26.860 --> 18:29.350
I promise to attend school properly,

18:29.400 --> 18:30.200
definitely won't be late,

18:30.200 --> 18:32.440
and won't lose points
for the class anymore.

18:32.440 --> 18:32.960
Okay?

18:33.460 --> 18:34.570
This is

18:34.600 --> 18:36.570
the math problem
we'll discuss in the second period.

18:36.570 --> 18:37.820
This is...

18:38.010 --> 18:38.720
Ms. Zhang.

18:38.720 --> 18:39.720
the last time I...

18:39.930 --> 18:40.550
Director.

18:40.620 --> 18:41.310
Don't mind me.

18:41.310 --> 18:41.910
Director.

18:42.800 --> 18:45.030
Wait, I have something
to discuss with you.

18:45.030 --> 18:45.720
Ms. Zhang,

18:46.240 --> 18:47.200
for this mobilization meeting,

18:47.200 --> 18:47.940
as the student representative,

18:47.940 --> 18:49.940
I think we should let Jiang Yan do it.

18:50.200 --> 18:51.350
Sure, Jiang Yan is fine.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.090
No problem.

18:55.400 --> 18:56.000
Jiang Fan.

18:56.880 --> 18:59.230
You're usually close to Lu Xixiao.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.400
Has he said anything

19:00.400 --> 19:01.440
to you these past two days?

19:01.440 --> 19:02.020
No.

19:02.120 --> 19:03.640
I'm not that close to him.

19:03.770 --> 19:04.630
Say that again.

19:06.010 --> 19:06.590
Usually when we're together,

19:06.590 --> 19:07.420
I'm the one talking.

19:07.420 --> 19:08.400
He rarely speaks.

19:08.400 --> 19:09.220
He didn't say anything.

19:09.220 --> 19:10.220
He talks too much.

19:10.940 --> 19:12.520
Director, what's wrong?

19:12.550 --> 19:13.660
The Academic Affairs Office told me

19:13.660 --> 19:15.190
Lu Xixiao registered
for the college entrance exam.

19:15.190 --> 19:16.030
-Yes.
-But a few days ago...

19:16.030 --> 19:17.310
he kept asking

19:17.510 --> 19:18.270
how to get

19:18.270 --> 19:19.750
academic certificates for studying abroad

19:19.750 --> 19:20.810
and things like that.

19:20.810 --> 19:22.000
But I remember his family

19:22.000 --> 19:23.800
never mentioned sending him abroad.

19:23.800 --> 19:24.670
Don't you think

19:24.690 --> 19:25.690
we should contact his family

19:25.690 --> 19:27.090
to verify the situation?

19:27.100 --> 19:28.290
If it's true,

19:28.310 --> 19:29.570
we do need to verify it.

19:30.020 --> 19:31.500
Lu Xixiao is going abroad?

19:32.080 --> 19:32.690
Jiang Fan.

19:33.450 --> 19:35.110
Have you heard him mention it?

19:35.690 --> 19:36.910
Mention what? No.

19:37.010 --> 19:37.980
Talk straight.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.270
No, he didn't.

19:39.270 --> 19:39.640
Never mentioned it.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.960
Why are kids nowadays

19:41.280 --> 19:42.650
all so headstrong?

19:42.680 --> 19:43.670
Such a big thing,

19:43.700 --> 19:44.440
and they don't discuss it with parents

19:44.440 --> 19:45.240
or teachers.

19:45.260 --> 19:45.980
Yeah.

19:46.680 --> 19:47.740
We can't control them anymore.

19:47.740 --> 19:48.400
Director.

19:53.080 --> 19:54.880
The one going abroad is not Lu Xixiao.

19:54.880 --> 19:55.600
It's me.

19:57.000 --> 19:57.790
Zhou Wan.

19:58.310 --> 19:59.110
When did you decide to go abroad?

19:59.110 --> 19:59.830
Who asked you to do that?

19:59.830 --> 20:00.310
Why didn't you

20:00.310 --> 20:01.370
tell me about this?

20:02.420 --> 20:03.440
In your current situation,

20:03.440 --> 20:04.510
going abroad without someone
to accompany you

20:04.510 --> 20:06.110
is very dangerous, you know?

20:06.670 --> 20:08.380
It was just a whim.

20:09.220 --> 20:11.350
I probably won't get accepted anyway.

20:11.900 --> 20:14.110
I didn't understand
the application materials.

20:14.110 --> 20:15.840
Lu Xixiao has many relatives
who went abroad,

20:15.840 --> 20:17.420
so I asked him to ask around for me,

20:17.420 --> 20:19.510
so I could prepare accordingly.

20:20.630 --> 20:21.760
He was asking for me.

20:22.410 --> 20:23.470
So that's how it is.

20:24.250 --> 20:25.310
Zhou Wan, next time

20:25.320 --> 20:26.680
if you have any plans for the future,

20:26.680 --> 20:27.860
talk to the teachers.

20:27.860 --> 20:28.720
We will help you make decisions.

20:28.720 --> 20:29.880
The time left for your senior year

20:29.880 --> 20:30.740
is running out.

20:31.380 --> 20:32.000
I know.

20:32.020 --> 20:33.470
Mr. Zhao, please continue your criticism.

20:33.470 --> 20:34.760
-Okay.
-Thank you, Ms. Zhang.

20:34.760 --> 20:35.960
Take care, Director.

20:36.070 --> 20:36.800
Go back.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.280
You heard him.

20:40.230 --> 20:42.380
The Director knows
all about your situation.

20:42.380 --> 20:43.730
Look at Zhou Wan.

20:44.640 --> 20:46.680
She's already looking
into studying abroad.

20:46.680 --> 20:49.190
This is the final moment
of your high school.

20:50.010 --> 20:51.070
I'm talking to you.

20:51.890 --> 20:53.950
Didn't you tell me to look at Zhou Wan?

20:54.050 --> 20:55.800
Is that what I meant by "look"?

20:56.290 --> 20:57.550
Did I mean literally looking at her?

20:57.550 --> 20:59.430
Why don't you look at yourself first?

20:59.430 --> 21:01.480
I meant you should learn from her.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.000
You can go.

21:03.500 --> 21:04.270
Thank you, sir.

21:04.270 --> 21:05.600
I'll be going back then.

21:08.310 --> 21:11.260
[Yangming High School]

21:11.400 --> 21:14.910
[Band 9 Expert; IELTS Reading
Past Papers and Explanations; 7]

21:16.290 --> 21:18.580
Xixiao, the clothes are washed.

21:18.880 --> 21:19.750
Is it convenient now

21:19.750 --> 21:21.210
to put them in your closet?

21:23.040 --> 21:24.380
Yes, come in.

21:27.820 --> 21:28.680
Please come in.

21:36.590 --> 21:37.840
So hot.

21:38.680 --> 21:39.260
What?

21:40.480 --> 21:41.610
I mean your t-shirt.

21:41.430 --> 21:44.010
[So hot]

21:41.640 --> 21:42.730
It says "so hot".

21:42.760 --> 21:43.640
It doesn't seem like

21:43.640 --> 21:45.290
your usual style.

21:45.480 --> 21:47.340
Does it have any special meaning?

21:50.830 --> 21:52.480
I think it does.

21:54.150 --> 21:55.480
I'll put it away for you.

22:04.940 --> 22:05.910
Ms. Chen.

22:07.860 --> 22:09.990
Please throw that t-shirt away later.

22:10.930 --> 22:11.450
Okay.

22:22.770 --> 22:24.310
I've already taken care
of your foundation program application

22:24.310 --> 22:25.020
and flight tickets,

22:25.020 --> 22:25.830
without

22:25.830 --> 22:26.940
your dad knowing.

22:27.350 --> 22:27.880
Remember,

22:27.880 --> 22:29.160
you owe me a big favor.

22:40.730 --> 22:43.370
[Outpatient Clinic; Outpatient Building]

22:48.180 --> 22:49.320
Here is your medicine.

22:49.320 --> 22:50.360
Please check it.

22:51.150 --> 22:51.750
Thank you.

22:51.760 --> 22:52.200
Okay.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.830
Next, please.

22:54.560 --> 22:56.090
Okay, please wait a moment.

23:28.010 --> 23:29.740
Where did your money come from?

23:31.400 --> 23:32.800
I earned it from working.

23:34.330 --> 23:35.940
You are just a student.

23:36.540 --> 23:38.740
Where did you work to earn so much money?

23:39.780 --> 23:41.440
How many times have I told you?

23:41.710 --> 23:43.740
The most important thing for you
is the college entrance exam.

23:43.740 --> 23:44.590
I am perfectly fine.

23:44.590 --> 23:45.900
There's nothing wrong with me.

23:45.900 --> 23:46.680
Can you

23:46.680 --> 23:48.350
stop worrying about me?

23:48.350 --> 23:49.200
You should worry more about yourself...

23:49.200 --> 23:50.550
I want you to be well.

23:51.820 --> 23:53.290
I want you to get better.

23:53.310 --> 23:54.160
I don't want to see

23:54.160 --> 23:55.310
you having to earn money at your age.

23:55.310 --> 23:56.200
It's too hard.

24:12.590 --> 24:13.660
Trust me.

24:14.280 --> 24:15.750
This money is all from

24:15.750 --> 24:16.750
my part-time job.

24:17.070 --> 24:18.600
There is no problem with it.

24:19.690 --> 24:21.550
After the college entrance exam,

24:21.920 --> 24:23.450
I will go out and make money.

24:25.350 --> 24:27.410
Our lives will get better and better.

24:28.200 --> 24:28.750
Okay.

24:39.970 --> 24:41.230
You are all I have.

24:42.920 --> 24:45.420
I can't just ignore you.

24:46.120 --> 24:47.080
Okay.

24:47.820 --> 24:49.150
Don't say silly things.

24:49.920 --> 24:51.970
I'm always by your side.

24:55.880 --> 24:57.220
Let's go home.

25:22.820 --> 25:25.020
Grandma's medical expenses are very high.

25:25.020 --> 25:26.070
The money for the hospital

25:26.070 --> 25:27.220
must be paid in full.

25:32.580 --> 25:34.380
So that's what this is all about.

25:35.310 --> 25:36.980
You're just here for money.

25:39.000 --> 25:40.460
She talks about you often.

25:43.010 --> 25:44.610
Did she say I was ungrateful?

25:45.730 --> 25:47.500
She told me not to blame you.

25:48.810 --> 25:49.640
Saying you're just

25:49.640 --> 25:50.700
trying to survive.

25:54.180 --> 25:56.440
Then your grandmother is very sensible.

25:58.310 --> 26:00.580
Only you have never understood.

26:07.390 --> 26:08.750
You took all the money

26:08.750 --> 26:09.680
dad left behind.

26:09.850 --> 26:10.750
For the past 10 years,

26:10.750 --> 26:11.480
you haven't given me a penny

26:11.480 --> 26:12.680
in child support.

26:12.810 --> 26:14.170
I didn't care before.

26:14.830 --> 26:16.490
But now Grandma is sick

26:17.260 --> 26:19.190
and desperately needs this money.

26:22.770 --> 26:24.630
I'm just taking back what's mine.

26:25.130 --> 26:25.860
Zhou Wan.

26:26.550 --> 26:27.480
Do you think I had it easy

26:27.480 --> 26:28.610
back then?

26:29.480 --> 26:30.550
Do you think my money

26:30.550 --> 26:32.360
grows on trees?

26:32.720 --> 26:34.420
What could your father's little money

26:34.420 --> 26:35.620
even cover back then?

26:36.790 --> 26:38.720
You really think too highly of him.

26:46.490 --> 26:49.180
[Boya Building]

26:49.300 --> 26:50.780
[Build in silence, strike with brilliance]

26:50.270 --> 26:51.950
Only Xixiao is absent.

26:50.800 --> 26:52.270
[Pen for timeless strategy,
spear for vast conquest]

26:52.720 --> 26:54.680
Everyone in Class 7 is here.

26:54.750 --> 26:55.790
Good luck on the college entrance exam.

26:55.790 --> 26:56.640
Class 7!

26:57.030 --> 26:59.830
-Go for the college entrance exam!
-Class 7.

26:59.830 --> 27:00.620
Look here.

27:00.680 --> 27:01.720
The speech is about to start.

27:01.720 --> 27:02.750
I can't find Jiang Yan.

27:02.750 --> 27:03.660
I don't know where he went.

27:03.660 --> 27:04.510
He'll be the first one
to go on stage, right?

27:04.510 --> 27:05.770
Yes, what should we do?

27:05.770 --> 27:06.970
What about asking the other students?

27:06.970 --> 27:08.010
I sent my students to look for him,

27:08.010 --> 27:09.740
but they haven't come back yet.

27:10.430 --> 27:12.070
Who are you thinking about,

27:12.070 --> 27:13.150
little girl?

27:14.820 --> 27:16.180
No one.

27:23.800 --> 27:25.420
You shouldn't be here.

27:26.340 --> 27:27.160
What's wrong?

27:27.800 --> 27:29.200
Don't I go to school here?

27:31.060 --> 27:32.920
You really haven't changed a bit.

27:37.160 --> 27:38.070
Do you really think the world

27:38.070 --> 27:39.310
revolves around you?

28:04.180 --> 28:05.280
-Well…
-The student's back.

28:05.280 --> 28:06.410
I checked the classroom

28:06.410 --> 28:07.450
and the office,

28:07.470 --> 28:09.600
but couldn't find Jiang Yan anywhere.

28:09.850 --> 28:11.310
Go back and sit down first.

28:11.640 --> 28:12.400
Ms. Zhang.

28:12.500 --> 28:14.350
Jiang Yan hasn't been found yet?

28:14.420 --> 28:16.140
We can't find him, Director.

28:20.640 --> 28:21.420
Zhou Wan.

28:21.450 --> 28:22.720
The speech is about to start.

28:22.720 --> 28:24.210
I really can't find Jiang Yan.

28:24.210 --> 28:25.310
I happen to have the script here.

28:25.310 --> 28:26.890
How about you take his place
and give the speech?

28:26.890 --> 28:27.870
I agree.

28:28.850 --> 28:30.490
Yeah, you can definitely do it.

28:30.490 --> 28:31.070
Keep in mind,

28:31.070 --> 28:32.400
show some passion.

28:41.120 --> 28:42.760
Lu Xixiao, listen to me.

28:44.010 --> 28:45.490
Stop pestering Zhou Wan.

28:46.200 --> 28:47.440
If you want to ruin your own life,

28:47.440 --> 28:48.200
fine.

28:49.410 --> 28:51.210
Don't drag others down with you.

28:52.350 --> 28:54.040
We are not like you.

28:59.110 --> 29:00.910
But I seem to know better than her

29:01.810 --> 29:03.340
what kind of person you are.

29:37.770 --> 29:39.760
A younger brother
hitting his older brother?

29:39.760 --> 29:40.830
Say that again.

29:42.340 --> 29:44.270
My birthday is earlier than yours.

29:45.000 --> 29:46.000
And your mom...

29:46.020 --> 29:46.830
Shut up!

29:56.290 --> 29:57.940
If you bring that up again,

29:58.340 --> 30:00.010
I'll punch you in the face.

30:04.070 --> 30:06.090
Ten years forging the sword,

30:06.280 --> 30:08.400
today its edge is revealed.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.120
Next, please welcome

30:10.140 --> 30:13.160
Zhou Wan, student representative
of the graduating classes,

30:13.160 --> 30:14.760
to the stage to give a speech.

30:14.960 --> 30:15.680
Please welcome her.

30:15.680 --> 30:20.510
Great!

30:22.070 --> 30:23.440
Zhou Wan!

30:23.440 --> 30:24.720
Zhou Wan!

30:34.320 --> 30:36.780
[Ten years forging the sword,
today its edge is revealed]

30:36.890 --> 30:41.550
[Yangming High School]

30:42.770 --> 30:44.730
Dear teachers, fellow students,

30:44.830 --> 30:45.760
hello everyone.

30:45.790 --> 30:47.680
Great!

30:50.270 --> 30:51.780
I'm Zhou Wan from Class 1,

30:51.800 --> 30:52.400
Grade 12.

30:56.070 --> 30:57.230
[Build in silence, strike with brilliance]

30:56.440 --> 30:57.670
The college entrance exam is coming.

30:57.250 --> 30:58.620
[Pen for timeless strategy,
spear for vast conquest]

30:58.490 --> 31:00.150
I believe you feel the same as me,

30:58.640 --> 30:59.930
[Know your direction, aim your goals;
walk the path with firm steps]

31:00.030 --> 31:02.080
[Ten years forging the sword,
today its edge is revealed]

31:00.240 --> 31:02.160
both nervous and anxious.

31:05.030 --> 31:06.070
For us,

31:06.640 --> 31:07.550
this also means

31:07.550 --> 31:09.120
that our 3 years of high school

31:09.120 --> 31:10.450
are coming to an end.

31:10.680 --> 31:13.190
The classmates who have been
with us for 3 years

31:13.190 --> 31:14.850
will also part ways.

31:16.000 --> 31:18.130
Parting is always full of reluctance.

31:18.490 --> 31:19.840
But what I want to say is,

31:22.020 --> 31:23.960
this parting is not forever.

31:25.500 --> 31:26.670
One day,

31:27.680 --> 31:28.920
we will meet again.

31:37.480 --> 31:38.700
During this time,

31:39.020 --> 31:41.130
I hope we will not forget each other

31:41.450 --> 31:42.650
and leave no regrets.

31:43.790 --> 31:45.070
No matter the result,

31:45.940 --> 31:47.980
this time of giving it our all

31:48.370 --> 31:49.920
will be the brightest medal

31:49.940 --> 31:51.300
in our lives.

31:51.440 --> 31:53.400
Great!

31:54.420 --> 31:55.260
Finally,

31:55.550 --> 31:57.170
let's wish each other

31:58.480 --> 31:59.810
a bright future

32:00.310 --> 32:01.610
and great success!

32:01.750 --> 32:04.030
Great!

32:04.750 --> 32:05.880
Wishing all of you

32:06.030 --> 32:07.420
a bright future

32:07.480 --> 32:08.640
and great success!

32:08.640 --> 32:10.070
Great!

32:10.070 --> 32:11.350
A bright future,

32:11.550 --> 32:13.220
and great success!

32:13.310 --> 32:14.990
A bright future,

32:15.110 --> 32:16.850
and great success!

32:16.920 --> 32:18.450
A bright future,

32:18.680 --> 32:20.280
and great success!

32:20.480 --> 32:22.070
A bright future,

32:22.160 --> 32:23.680
and great success!

32:24.000 --> 32:25.460
A bright future,

32:25.790 --> 32:27.400
and great success!

32:27.550 --> 32:29.110
A bright future,

32:29.310 --> 32:31.320
and great success!

32:52.550 --> 32:53.750
Why are you guys here?

33:01.440 --> 33:02.200
Did you two fight?

33:02.200 --> 33:02.790
Yes.

33:06.510 --> 33:07.310
I hit him.

33:08.570 --> 33:10.230
Watch your mouth from now on,

33:10.960 --> 33:12.490
or there will be a next time.

33:13.400 --> 33:14.430
Am I clear?

33:33.750 --> 33:35.080
What exactly happened?

33:39.080 --> 33:40.680
I just wanted to protect you.

33:42.780 --> 33:45.110
So you picked
a fight with Lu Xixiao first?

33:47.360 --> 33:48.690
What's the difference?

33:50.490 --> 33:51.520
Everyone in school knows

33:51.520 --> 33:53.030
what kind of person he is.

33:53.590 --> 33:54.270
You even went to see

33:54.270 --> 33:55.220
the director for him.

33:55.220 --> 33:56.680
There won't be a next time.

33:59.880 --> 34:01.480
I'm not a good person either.

34:01.620 --> 34:03.280
I don't need your protection.

34:05.420 --> 34:07.280
If you really treat me as a friend,

34:07.660 --> 34:08.670
then stop interfering

34:08.670 --> 34:10.070
with my choices and life.

34:20.650 --> 34:22.699
Finally graduated!

34:23.850 --> 34:25.770
No more math homework.

34:28.590 --> 34:29.679
Wan.

34:29.880 --> 34:30.750
We agreed,

34:30.780 --> 34:32.280
you have to think of me after graduation.

34:32.280 --> 34:33.110
Do you hear me?

34:33.150 --> 34:34.750
And you have to text me often.

34:34.760 --> 34:35.510
Don't think I don't know

34:35.510 --> 34:36.850
that you leave me on read.

34:36.850 --> 34:44.659
[Zhixing Building]

34:37.260 --> 34:38.699
I didn't mean it.

34:39.230 --> 34:40.150
If you do this again,

34:40.150 --> 34:40.760
I will wait

34:40.760 --> 34:42.020
at your door every day.

34:42.920 --> 34:43.510
Come on.

34:43.670 --> 34:44.320
Really?

34:44.320 --> 34:45.980
Then I'll pester you forever.

34:46.199 --> 34:46.760
Okay.

34:50.810 --> 34:51.780
Wan,

34:51.989 --> 34:53.030
this is our last time

34:53.030 --> 34:54.219
going home from school together.

34:54.219 --> 34:55.600
I will miss you.

34:56.030 --> 34:57.190
Remember to

34:57.210 --> 34:58.240
review well at home,

34:58.240 --> 34:58.840
got it?

35:00.790 --> 35:01.740
Don't worry.

35:02.600 --> 35:04.520
You, play less on your phone,

35:04.540 --> 35:06.250
and review well these days.

35:06.370 --> 35:07.280
I know.

35:07.280 --> 35:08.210
If you can't, come to my house.

35:08.210 --> 35:08.890
We will study together.

35:08.890 --> 35:11.020
So you won't keep calling me
to ask questions.

35:11.020 --> 35:12.880
I know you like me the most.

35:15.010 --> 35:15.900
I'm leaving.

35:18.000 --> 35:18.410
Bye.

35:18.440 --> 35:19.050
Bye.

35:19.090 --> 35:21.420
[Zhixing Building]

35:19.640 --> 35:20.580
Dad!

35:54.310 --> 35:55.100
You're back.

35:57.460 --> 35:58.850
You've already got guaranteed admission.

35:58.850 --> 36:00.980
Why do you still go to school everyday?

36:03.990 --> 36:05.650
Don't you want to stay at home?

36:08.930 --> 36:09.740
No.

36:10.350 --> 36:12.080
There was a mobilization meeting today.

36:12.080 --> 36:13.170
As the student representative,

36:13.170 --> 36:14.370
I had to give a speech.

36:17.510 --> 36:18.880
I want to remind you,

36:19.260 --> 36:20.500
even if you've got guaranteed admission,

36:20.500 --> 36:21.770
you can't slack off.

36:22.380 --> 36:24.480
You should consider
a direct master–PhD track

36:24.480 --> 36:26.190
and earn all three
of your degrees from Tsinghua.

36:26.190 --> 36:27.000
Don't let down

36:27.000 --> 36:28.070
my expectations,

36:28.260 --> 36:28.990
understand?

36:33.280 --> 36:34.070
I know.

36:40.830 --> 36:42.150
You went on stage,

36:42.550 --> 36:44.190
but you didn't dress up.

36:44.380 --> 36:46.320
What a mess. Look at you.

36:47.700 --> 36:49.100
Pay attention next time.

37:03.320 --> 37:04.180
Anything else?

37:09.320 --> 37:11.120
If not, go to bed early.

37:11.330 --> 37:12.390
Don't stay up late.

37:50.370 --> 37:52.080
But I seem to know better than her

37:52.080 --> 37:53.610
what kind of person you are.

37:54.320 --> 37:55.650
A younger brother
hitting his older brother?

37:55.650 --> 37:57.060
If you bring that up again,

37:57.060 --> 37:58.920
I will punch you in the face.

37:59.020 --> 38:00.290
I just wanted to protect you.

38:00.290 --> 38:02.150
If you really treat me as a friend,

38:02.610 --> 38:03.550
then stop interfering

38:03.550 --> 38:04.950
with my choices and life.

38:20.220 --> 38:20.780
Ping.

38:23.590 --> 38:25.130
I graduated.

38:25.160 --> 38:28.020
Really? Great!

38:30.670 --> 38:31.920
Congratulations.

38:31.920 --> 38:33.440
Thank you, Ping.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.210
Good thing you didn't learn from me.

38:35.210 --> 38:36.400
If you don't work hard when young,

38:36.400 --> 38:38.730
you'll have to fix motors
when you grow up.

38:39.670 --> 38:41.020
Can't you say something nice?

38:41.020 --> 38:42.350
I'm going to fix motors.

38:48.880 --> 38:49.540
Xixiao.

38:51.010 --> 38:53.340
Don't miss me too much
when you're abroad.

38:54.390 --> 38:55.260
Am I crazy?

38:55.630 --> 38:57.710
Why would I miss you
every day for no reason?

38:57.710 --> 38:58.630
You'll be thousands of miles from home.

38:58.630 --> 39:00.430
Who else would you miss if not me?

39:01.320 --> 39:03.620
Besides, who bandaged your wound?

39:04.550 --> 39:06.230
When I'm not by your side in the future,

39:06.230 --> 39:06.840
who will wrap it

39:06.840 --> 39:08.040
with such nice gauze?

39:08.620 --> 39:09.760
I'll just take it as you cursing me

39:09.760 --> 39:10.960
to get hurt every day.

39:12.260 --> 39:13.440
Didn't you say you weren't
coming this afternoon?

39:13.440 --> 39:14.970
Why did you come for a fight?

39:15.360 --> 39:16.480
I missed you.

39:16.920 --> 39:17.590
You told me to miss you every day.

39:17.590 --> 39:18.890
I just came to see you, okay?

39:18.890 --> 39:21.020
If you came to see me, just do it openly.

39:21.690 --> 39:23.320
Tell me, were you there to see...

39:23.320 --> 39:24.960
Shut up. Shut up.

39:27.150 --> 39:28.000
To be honest,

39:28.120 --> 39:29.530
Zhou Wan is quite loyal.

39:30.330 --> 39:31.500
Even though you two fell out,

39:31.500 --> 39:32.510
she was still willing to cover for you

39:32.510 --> 39:35.170
in front of the teachers
about you going abroad.

39:35.620 --> 39:36.190
What?

39:36.490 --> 39:37.340
No, nothing.

39:37.840 --> 39:39.100
I didn't say anything.

39:47.560 --> 39:48.420
Where did he go?

39:49.120 --> 39:51.840
He didn't even put away
the tools after using them.

39:51.840 --> 39:53.180
If he doesn't work hard,

39:53.330 --> 39:54.930
he'll have to fix motors too.

39:55.750 --> 39:57.810
You said that on purpose, didn't you?

39:57.920 --> 39:59.920
♪ Infinite descent ♪

40:01.190 --> 40:03.320
♪ Gradually sinking ♪

40:04.960 --> 40:07.140
♪ The unease once touched ♪

40:08.600 --> 40:11.280
♪ Smooths out the wrinkles of the heart ♪

40:14.080 --> 40:17.340
♪ Even if you remove the rooted mask ♪

40:18.410 --> 40:20.790
♪ Let joy and sorrow be laid bare ♪

40:21.690 --> 40:24.570
♪ Still cannot hide the shadow behind ♪

40:25.550 --> 40:28.180
♪ That's all it is ♪

40:26.540 --> 40:28.580
[East of the gate]

40:29.150 --> 40:32.420
♪ When, where, has it ever appeared ♪

40:32.600 --> 40:36.190
♪ A world without ignorance,
without desire, without end ♪

40:34.050 --> 40:34.850
Lu Xixiao.

40:35.110 --> 40:36.630
School's over. Why did you come here?

40:36.320 --> 40:39.750
♪ I come, I go, I stay,
yet I am not myself ♪

40:36.660 --> 40:37.810
I'm going to be late.

40:39.890 --> 40:43.740
♪ As if in madness, as if in a dream,
arriving as promised ♪

41:05.310 --> 41:07.280
♪ Infinite descent ♪

41:08.690 --> 41:10.780
♪ Gradually sinking ♪

41:12.190 --> 41:14.250
♪ The bubbles I once held tightly ♪

41:15.820 --> 41:18.040
♪ Cannot hold onto this flicker ♪

41:17.830 --> 41:21.460
[I take pride in Yangming today, and
Yangming will take pride in me tomorrow]

41:19.800 --> 41:21.630
♪ Nothing to do with love or fate ♪

41:23.120 --> 41:25.440
♪ Ending without a cause ♪

41:26.830 --> 41:28.800
♪ The unease once touched ♪

41:30.470 --> 41:33.500
♪ Smooths out the wrinkles of the heart ♪

41:35.930 --> 41:39.150
♪ Even if you remove the rooted mask ♪

41:39.920 --> 41:42.570
♪ Let joy and sorrow be laid bare ♪

41:41.050 --> 41:47.450
[Candidates Must Know]

41:43.770 --> 41:46.240
♪ Still cannot hide the shadow behind ♪

41:47.470 --> 41:49.760
♪ Hysterical collapse ♪

41:49.750 --> 41:51.050
[Candidates Must Know]

41:50.930 --> 41:53.490
♪ If meeting means destined separation ♪

41:51.140 --> 41:52.030
[Yangming High School]

41:54.470 --> 41:57.430
♪ Then it is an addiction
life cannot bear ♪

41:58.500 --> 42:00.960
♪ Let me fail,
or bloom until the flower fades ♪

42:01.980 --> 42:04.970
[East of the gate]

42:02.220 --> 42:04.640
♪ That's all it is ♪

42:04.970 --> 42:07.320
[2016]

42:05.740 --> 42:08.590
♪ When, where, has it ever appeared ♪

42:07.320 --> 42:11.190
[2026]

42:08.760 --> 42:12.390
♪ A world without ignorance,
without desire, without end ♪

42:12.550 --> 42:16.180
♪ I come, I go, I stay,
yet I am not myself ♪

42:16.280 --> 42:20.050
♪ As if in madness, as if in a dream,
arriving as promised ♪

42:19.670 --> 42:21.550
Can I touch you?

42:23.180 --> 42:24.850
You smell so good.

42:38.440 --> 42:41.210
♪ When, where, has it ever appeared ♪

42:41.330 --> 42:45.290
♪ A world without ignorance,
without desire, without end ♪

42:45.410 --> 42:48.750
♪ I come, I go, I stay,
yet I am not myself ♪

42:48.900 --> 42:52.910
♪ As if in madness, as if in a dream,
arriving as promised ♪

42:53.270 --> 42:54.200
Long time no see.

43:01.860 --> 43:02.710
Long time no see.
